These are explicitly selected source references, not native quest replacements.
Their DE/EN passages may represent different versions despite sharing an ID.
Uncorroborated objectives are a separate source-field phase; development/unused
text, uncertain UI concatenations and unresolved controls are excluded per field.
Only exact description suffixes and trailing empty reward headings are removed.
Client guards retain only the applicable source libraries, without creating
empty foreign-client buckets. Author permission reported by the project owner
also covers these databases; upstream material is not relicensed by this addon.

The per-field provenance, accepted IDs, source/input hashes, and generated file
hashes are recorded in source-manifest.json. Raw source remains retrievable from
the pinned revision; these are static compatibility candidates, not live-certified
Forever quest variants.

All game names and quest text originate from World of Warcraft by Blizzard
Entertainment. No quest text is generated or machine translated by this pack.

